<title>GERMANY: Mercedes H1 sales at 38.32 bln marks.</title>
<headline>Mercedes H1 sales at 38.32 bln marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  38,317  vs N/A</p>
<p>    --of which cars			    22,672  vs N/A</p>
<p>    --of which trucks			  15,645  vs N/A</p>
<p>    Production (number of cars)	    320,950 vs N/A</p>
<p>    Production (number of trucks)	  171,922 vs N/A</p>
<p>    Unit sales of cars			 318,063 vs N/A</p>
<p>    Unit sales of trucks		     168,376 vs N/A</p>
<p>    Workforce (headcount)		    196,387 vs N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car and truck maker is Mercedes-Benz AG. The figures were done according to German accounting standards and not U.S. GAAP. The GAAP figures will be released in London at 1000 GMT.</p>
</text>
